WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,560
Young Master, you are better than me. I will rely on you to take over the job.

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:05,560
Okay, hurry up and get the animal blood. We all hurry up.

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:07,750
Now the ten kinds of third-level temporary jobs have been harvested.

4
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:09,750
The only difference is these two fourth-level temporary jobs.

5
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:12,940
But the fourth-level temporary job has given birth to a weak temporary job

6
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,940
We have to let Xue Wu and the others come out to help.

7
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:26,520
Okay, let's get started.

8
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:29,120
It is indeed a fire thing

9
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:39,030
Fortunately, the strength of the fourth-level temporary job is not as good as that of the fourth-level temporary beast.

10
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:42,030
Plus you can't move, so it shouldn't take much effort.
